# File Documentation
#
# Motivation:
#   Keep this project-owned artifact understandable to humans and automation.
#
# Intent:
#   Document the artifact role in the Mathformer repository while preserving its native format.
#
# Function:
#   Supports the surrounding workflow indicated by its directory, filename, and tests.
#
# Maintenance Notes:
#   Keep this header synchronized with major responsibility changes, and prefer updating tests or examples when behavior changes.

